<view class="page result-page"><view class="topbar"><view class="brand"><text class="brand-mark">书</text>趣味闯关</view><text class="tiny-label">学习成果</text></view><page-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bind:retry="refresh"/><block wx:if="{{result && !loading && !error}}"><view class="result-hero fade"><image class="result-scene" src="/assets/v2/landscape.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="completion-mark">学有所获</view><view class="eyebrow">{{result.themeName}} · {{result.chapterName}}</view><view class="heading">本章节已完成</view><view class="intro">又读懂了一段乡村故事，<br/>让这份收获，留在心里。</view></view><view class="panel result-panel"><view class="accuracy"><text class="accuracy-value">{{result.accuracy}}<text>%</text></text><view class="small">本次作答正确率</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="result-stats"><view><view class="stat-number">+{{result.earned}}</view><view class="small">本次学习积分</view></view><view><view class="stat-number">{{result.totalPoints}}</view><view class="small">累计学习积分</view></view></view></view><view class="note" wx:if="{{result.earned === 0}}">本章积分已领取。再次阅读仍然有收获，积分不会重复计入。</view><view class="note" wx:if="{{result.themeComplete}}">本主题的全部章节已完成，电子学习证书已为你记录这份成长。</view><view class="button-stack"><ui-button class="action-button" wx:if="{{result.nextChapterId}}" label="探索下一章节" bind:action="next"/><ui-button class="action-button" wx:if="{{result.themeComplete}}" label="查看主题学习证书" bind:action="certificate"/><ui-button class="action-button" variant="secondary" label="返回主题" bind:action="theme"/></view><view class="footer-note">学习积分，记录每一步探索。</view></block></view>
